Hi!

TimeBrowse v0.5 is released!
http://sourceforge.net/projects/timebrowse/

This time, snapshot manger thin out old snapshots based on the sparse
parameters.  So created snapshots decrease after specified period of time.
Still, important snapshots are preserved until specified period of time.

Changes are following.

TimeBrowse-v0.5  Sun Mar 20 18:17:57 JST 2011
        * print timestamps in locale dependent format (Ryusuke Konishi)

nilfs2_ss_manager-v0.5  Sun Mar 20 18:17:57 JST 2011
        * add passive mode (Ryusuke Konishi)
        * add sparse snapshot functionality

enjoy!
